{"case_id": "fx-08-long-analysis", "type": "ask", "pattern": "long_analysis", "space": {"id": "sp_fx_d8", "kind": "dm", "is_dm": true, "name": "D", "member_count": 2, "has_external": false}, "message": {"id": "m08", "time": "2026-01-05T11:10:00+08:00", "sender": "D", "sender_account_id": "acc_d", "thread_key": "th_m08", "text": "翻了上季度的工单：总量多了三成，但类别没变。主要是两三个类别突然变多，另外冒出几类新的。我猜原因有三种：一是新客户接入，二是老客户用得更多，三是分类口径改过。你觉得先查哪种？", "media": [], "mentions": [], "mentions_owner": false, "facts": {"dm": true, "mentioned": false, "reply_to_me": false, "event_type": "im.dm", "via": "ws"}}, "replied_to": null, "thread": [], "thread_size": 1, "previous_space_messages": [{"id": "m08a", "time": "2026-01-05T11:00:00+08:00", "sender": "主人", "sender_account_id": "acc_owner", "is_owner": true, "is_steve_sent": false, "direction": "in", "status": "received", "thread_key": "th_m08a", "text": "帮我看看上季度工单怎么多了", "media": [], "mentions": []}], "gold_owner_messages_60min": [{"id": "g08a", "time": null, "minutes_after": 5.1, "same_thread": false, "text": "第一种跟新客户接入有关", "media": []}, {"id": "g08b", "time": null, "minutes_after": 5.5, "same_thread": false, "text": "第三种口径确实改过", "media": []}], "steve": {"outcome": "ask", "ask_text": "看不懂这条在接着什么说：需要看三种原因的完整内容", "note": ""}, "owner_decision": {"created": "2026-01-05T11:11:10+08:00", "choice": null}, "audit": []}
